<title>UK: SOCCER-GLENAVON BEAT CLIFTONVILLE 1-0 IN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GLENAVON BEAT CLIFTONVILLE 1-0 IN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glenavon beat Cliftonville 1-0 in the Northern Irish Cup Final at Windsor Park on Saturday.</p>
